      "text": "How these are seen in game\n\n• The menu runs at 1600×900; Kei on the right is the looping Koikatsu idle.\n• Tablet pages are drawn at 720×500 and shown small, at an angle, through the bodycam (grain, lens bend), so keep text bold and high-contrast.\n• A dash means the system isn't in the game yet (capture, caches, checkpoint, credits, threat, carried items, ammo type).\n• Q / E or the mouse wheel flip pages; the tab highlight slides.",
